1
00:00:06,484 --> 00:00:13,344
I see you walk into the room, 
You bear a dark and heavy gloom.

2
00:00:15,469 --> 00:00:22,462
You do not speak, you do not eat, 
Come sit with me and take a seat.

3
00:00:23,457 --> 00:00:30,020
I hold you close, I feel you break, 
Your heavy heart begins to ache

4
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:38,852
I feel the love you carry through, 
My darling boy, I'm here for you.

5
00:00:44,048 --> 00:00:51,189
Three long dark weeks of missing her, 
To sleep apart was never fair.

6
00:00:53,275 --> 00:00:59,870
I know that rule was cold and wrong, 
You had to wait for far too long.

7
00:01:01,289 --> 00:01:07,758
I hold you close, I feel you break, 
Your heavy heart begins to ache.

8
00:01:08,034 --> 00:01:17,186
I feel the love you carry through, 
My darling boy, I'm here for you.

9
00:01:21,872 --> 00:01:29,288
That single week of being free, 
Showed what your true love ought to be.

10
00:01:31,284 --> 00:01:38,129
You break beneath this weight inside, 
With nowhere left for you to hide.

11
00:01:38,269 --> 00:01:45,090
I hold you close, I feel you break, 
Your heavy heart begins to ache.

12
00:01:45,100 --> 00:01:54,823
I feel the love you carry through, 
My darling boy, I'm here for you.

13
00:01:59,019 --> 00:02:06,630
I feel your love so pure and deep, 
It steals away your nightly sleep.

14
00:02:08,065 --> 00:02:15,504
You do not have to fight alone, 
Or turn your tender heart to stone.

15
00:02:16,134 --> 00:02:22,619
I hold you close, I feel you break, 
Your heavy heart begins to ache.

16
00:02:22,875 --> 00:02:32,356
I feel the love you carry through, 
My darling boy, I'm here for you.

17
00:02:36,489 --> 00:02:44,390
So lay your head upon my arm, 
I'll keep you safe from any harm.

18
00:02:45,733 --> 00:02:55,025
Inside this dark and quiet night, 
Until we find the morning light.

